 AI agent skill for Claude Code
 X A different skill called devpit is already there, so Devpit will not install
   its own.
   Remove or rename that devpit folder yourself if you want Devpit's skill
   instead.

 Lets Claude Code check which account each tool uses in a folder and explain
 why, using Devpit's read-only commands and its help pages.
   + Never changes anything without your yes: it asks first, every time.
   + Never reads account folders, login files or tokens.

 Where it goes
   default  C:\Users\you\.claude\skills\devpit\SKILL.md          X not Devpit's
            A devpit skill Devpit did not write.
   work     C:\Users\you\.devpit\accounts\claude\wo...\SKILL.md  X not Devpit's
            A devpit folder without Devpit's SKILL.md, holding other files.


